<h2>Quick triage</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Symptom</th><th>Most likely cause</th><th>Go to</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[Users see HTTP 502]</em></td><td><em>[Backend pool unhealthy]</em></td><td><ac:link ac:anchor="symptom-1"><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Symptom 1]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[Login loops back to the sign-in page]</em></td><td><em>[Clock skew with the identity provider]</em></td><td><ac:link ac:anchor="symptom-2"><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Symptom 2]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></td></tr>
