<h2>First five minutes</h2>
<p>Run these before anything else. They rule out the common causes.</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Health check</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[systemctl status example.service
curl -sS -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' https://example.internal/health
df -h /var
journalctl -u example.service --since '15 min ago' | tail -50]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
